      "description": {
        "id": "Mod karya Brumbek untuk Skyrim Special Edition yang merombak dan meningkatkan kualitas visual ribuan model objek 3D (static meshes) bawaan gim—seperti bangunan, perabotan, tali, hingga item kecil—agar memiliki poligon lebih halus, tekstur lebih presisi, dan tampilan lingkungan yang jauh lebih realistis.",
        "en": "Brumbek's mod for Skyrim Special Edition overhauls and improves the visual quality of thousands of the game's built-in 3D object models (static meshes)—such as buildings, furniture, ropes, and even small items—to have smoother polygons, more precise textures, and a much more realistic appearance of the environment."
      }
