      "description": {
        "id": "Mod karya wankingSkeever untuk Skyrim Special Edition yang memperbaiki berbagai cacat teknis pada model objek 3D (meshes) bawaan gim—seperti celah visual (gaps), kesalahan pemetaan UV, tekstur yang buram/terdistorsi, hingga bug pencahayaan—tanpa mengubah gaya visual asli bawaan gim.",
        "en": "WankingSkeever's mod for Skyrim Special Edition fixes various technical defects in the game's built-in 3D object models (meshes)—such as visual gaps, UV mapping errors, blurred/distorted textures, and even lighting bugs—without changing the game's original visual style."
