        "id": "Mod karya LucidAPs untuk Skyrim Special Edition yang meningkatkan jumlah poligon (polygon count) secara signifikan pada berbagai objek 3D bawaan gim—seperti bahan makanan, perabotan, tengkorak, tanaman, hingga artefak kecil—sehingga objek memiliki bentuk yang jauh lebih halus, bulat mendetail, dan realistis dibanding versi asli (vanilla).",
        "en": "A mod by LucidAPs for Skyrim Special Edition that significantly increases the number of polygons (polygon count) on various 3D objects built into the game—such as foodstuffs, furniture, skulls, plants, and even small artifacts—so that objects have much smoother, rounder, more detailed and realistic shapes than the original (vanilla) version."
